@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
    dcterms:title "RDF XSD 数据类型"@zh, "RDF XSD datatypes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "此文件描述 RDF 中使用的 XML Schema 数据类型。"@zh, "This file is a description of the XML Schema datatypes used in RDF"@en .

xsd:string
    rdfs:label "字符串"@zh, "string"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "字符串"@zh, "string"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "字符串。值空间：有限长度的 Unicode 字符序列。词法形式：符合 XML Char 产生式的任意有限长度 XML 字符序列（即 XML 允许的任意 Unicode 标量值）。"@zh, "Character strings. Value space: finite-length sequences of Unicode characters. Lexical form: any finite-length sequence of XML characters matching the XML Char production (i.e., any Unicode scalar value allowed by XML)."@en .

xsd:boolean
    rdfs:label "布尔值"@zh, "boolean"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "布尔值"@zh, "boolean"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "二值逻辑。词法形式：'true'、'false'、'1'、'0'。值空间：{真, 假}。"@zh, "Two-valued logic. Lexical forms: 'true', 'false', '1', '0'. Value space: {true, false}."@en .

xsd:decimal
    rdfs:label "十进制数"@zh, "decimal"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "十进制数"@zh, "decimal"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "任意精度十进制数。值空间：形如 i/10^n 的数，其中 i 和 n 为整数（n ≥ 0）。无特殊值（INF/NaN），且词法形式中无指数记法。词法形式：可选的前导符号后跟数字，可带有以 '.' 为小数分隔符的小数部分；不允许指数（例如 '-1.23'、'210'、'+100000.00'）。"@zh, "Arbitrary-precision decimal numbers. Value space: numbers of the form i/10^n, with i and n integers (n ≥ 0). No special values (INF/NaN) and no exponential notation in lexical form. Lexical form: an optional leading sign followed by digits, with an optional fractional part using '.' as the decimal separator; no exponent is permitted (e.g., '-1.23', '210', '+100000.00')."@en .

xsd:integer
    rdfs:label "整数"@zh, "integer"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "整数"@zh, "integer"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "任意大小的有符号整数。通过 fractionDigits=0 从 xsd:decimal 派生。词法形式：可选的前导符号后跟一个或多个十进制数字；无小数点或指数（例如 '-1'、'0'、'+100000'）。"@zh, "Signed integers of arbitrary size. Derived from xsd:decimal with fractionDigits=0. Lexical form: optional leading sign followed by one or more decimal digits; no decimal point or exponent (e.g., '-1', '0', '+100000')."@en .

xsd:double
    rdfs:label "64 位浮点数"@zh, "double"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "64 位浮点数"@zh, "64-bit floating-point number"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "double"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "IEEE 754 64 位浮点数。词法形式使用十进制或科学记数法，可带有前导符号和指数；允许特殊标记 'INF'、'+INF'、'-INF' 和 'NaN'；'+0' 和 '-0' 是不同的词法形式。词法形式到值的映射取决于此数据类型及其精度。词法形式（正则表达式风格）：(\\+|-)?([0-9]+(\\.[0-9]*)?|\\.[0-9]+)([Ee](\\+|-)?[0-9]+)? |(\\+|-)?INF|NaN."@zh, "IEEE 754 64-bit floating-point numbers. Lexical forms use decimal or scientific notation with optional leading sign and exponent; special tokens 'INF', '+INF', '-INF', and 'NaN' are permitted; '+0' and '-0' are distinct lexical forms. Mapping from lexical forms to values is specific to this datatype and its precision. Lexical form (regex-style): (\\+|-)?([0-9]+(\\.[0-9]*)?|\\.[0-9]+)([Ee](\\+|-)?[0-9]+)? |(\\+|-)?INF|NaN."@en .

xsd:float
    rdfs:label "32 位浮点数"@zh, "float"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 位浮点数"@zh, "32-bit floating-point number"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "float"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "IEEE 754 32 位浮点数。词法形式使用十进制或科学记数法，可带有前导符号和指数；允许特殊标记 'INF'、'+INF'、'-INF' 和 'NaN'；'+0' 和 '-0' 是不同的词法形式。词法形式到值的映射取决于此数据类型及其精度。词法形式（正则表达式风格）：(\\+|-)?([0-9]+(\\.[0-9]*)?|\\.[0-9]+)([Ee](\\+|-)?[0-9]+)? |(\\+|-)?INF|NaN."@zh, "IEEE 754 32-bit floating-point numbers. Lexical forms use decimal or scientific notation with optional leading sign and exponent; special tokens 'INF', '+INF', '-INF', and 'NaN' are permitted; '+0' and '-0' are distinct lexical forms. Mapping from lexical forms to values is specific to this datatype and its precision. Lexical form (regex-style): (\\+|-)?([0-9]+(\\.[0-9]*)?|\\.[0-9]+)([Ee](\\+|-)?[0-9]+)? |(\\+|-)?INF|NaN."@en .

xsd:date
    rdfs:label "日期"@zh, "date"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "日期"@zh, "date"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "日历日期表示为前闭后开的单日区间。词法形式：YYYY-MM-DD，可带时区。时区词法形式：'Z' 或形如 ±hh:mm 的偏移量，其中 00 ≤ mm ≤ 59 且 |offset| ≤ 14:00（例如 '2025-09-27Z'、'2025-09-27+02:00'）。"@zh, "Calendar dates as top-open day intervals. Lexical form: YYYY-MM-DD with optional timezone. Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or an offset of the form ±hh:mm with 00 ≤ mm ≤ 59 and |offset| ≤ 14:00 (e.g., '2025-09-27Z', '2025-09-27+02:00')."@en .

xsd:time
    rdfs:label "时刻"@zh, "time"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "时刻"@zh, "time"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "每天的同一时刻，或某一天的某个时刻。词法形式：hh:mm:ss(.s+)?，可带时区。时区词法形式：'Z' 或 ±hh:mm，其中 |offset| ≤ 14:00（例如 '23:59:59Z'、'08:15:30.5-05:00'）。"@zh, "Times that recur each day or occur on some day. Lexical form: hh:mm:ss(.s+)? with optional timezone. Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or ±hh:mm with |offset| ≤ 14:00 (e.g., '23:59:59Z', '08:15:30.5-05:00')."@en .

xsd:dateTime
    rdfs:label "日期和时间"@zh, "dateTime"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "日期和时间"@zh, "date and time"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "dateTime"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "时间瞬间，可带时区。词法形式：YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss(.s+)?，可带时区。具有不同显式偏移量的值可以表示同一瞬间。时区词法形式：'Z' 或 ±hh:mm，其中 |offset| ≤ 14:00（例如 '2025-09-27T14:03:00+02:00'）。"@zh, "Instants of time, optionally with timezone. Lexical form: YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss(.s+)? with optional timezone. Values with different explicit offsets can be equal as instants. Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or ±hh:mm with |offset| ≤ 14:00 (e.g., '2025-09-27T14:03:00+02:00')."@en .

xsd:dateTimeStamp
    rdfs:label "带时区的日期和时间"@zh, "dateTimeStamp"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "带时区的日期和时间"@zh, "date and time with timezone"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "dateTimeStamp"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "必须具有显式时区偏移量的日期和时间。词法形式：YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss(.s+)?(Z|±hh:mm)；时区偏移量为必需。"@zh, "Dates and times with a required explicit timezone offset. Lexical form: YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss(.s+)?(Z|±hh:mm); the timezone offset is mandatory."@en .

xsd:gYear
    rdfs:label "公历年份"@zh, "gYear"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "公历年份"@zh, "Gregorian year"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "gYear"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "公历年份。词法形式：CCYY（公元前年份可带有前导 '-'，时区可选）。时区词法形式：'Z' 或 ±hh:mm，其中 |offset| ≤ 14:00；年份符合 -?([1-9][0-9]{3,}|0[0-9]{3})。"@zh, "Gregorian years. Lexical form: CCYY (optionally with a leading '-' for years BCE and optional timezone). Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or ±hh:mm with |offset| ≤ 14:00; years are matched by -?([1-9][0-9]{3,}|0[0-9]{3})."@en .

xsd:gMonth
    rdfs:label "公历月份"@zh, "gMonth"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "公历月份"@zh, "Gregorian month"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "gMonth"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "每年重复的公历月份。词法形式：--MM，可带时区。时区词法形式：'Z' 或 ±hh:mm，其中 |offset| ≤ 14:00（例如 '--02Z'、'--11+05:30'）。"@zh, "Gregorian months recurring each year. Lexical form: --MM with optional timezone. Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or ±hh:mm with |offset| ≤ 14:00 (e.g., '--02Z', '--11+05:30')."@en .

xsd:gDay
    rdfs:label "公历月中的日"@zh, "gDay"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "公历月中的日"@zh, "Gregorian day"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "gDay"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "表示公历中一个月里的第几日，例如每月 15 日。词法形式：---DD，可带时区。时区词法形式：'Z' 或 ±hh:mm，其中 |offset| ≤ 14:00（例如 '---05Z'、'---31-03:00'）。"@zh, "Days in a month recurring each month. Lexical form: ---DD with optional timezone. Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or ±hh:mm with |offset| ≤ 14:00 (e.g., '---05Z', '---31-03:00')."@en .

xsd:gYearMonth
    rdfs:label "公历年份和月份"@zh, "gYearMonth"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "公历年份和月份"@zh, "Gregorian year and month"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "gYearMonth"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "公历年份和月份。词法形式：CCYY-MM，可带时区。时区词法形式：'Z' 或 ±hh:mm，其中 |offset| ≤ 14:00（例如 '2025-09Z'、'1999-12+01:00'）。"@zh, "Gregorian year-month pairs. Lexical form: CCYY-MM with optional timezone. Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or ±hh:mm with |offset| ≤ 14:00 (e.g., '2025-09Z', '1999-12+01:00')."@en .

xsd:gMonthDay
    rdfs:label "公历月份和日"@zh, "gMonthDay"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "公历月份和日"@zh, "Gregorian month and day"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "gMonthDay"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "每年重复的月份和日。词法形式：--MM-DD，可带时区。时区词法形式：'Z' 或 ±hh:mm，其中 |offset| ≤ 14:00（例如 '--12-31Z'、'--02-29+09:00'）。"@zh, "Month-day pairs recurring each year. Lexical form: --MM-DD with optional timezone. Timezone lexical forms: 'Z' or ±hh:mm with |offset| ≤ 14:00 (e.g., '--12-31Z', '--02-29+09:00')."@en .

xsd:duration
    rdfs:label "时长"@zh, "duration"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "时长"@zh, "duration"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "按 ISO 8601 表示的时长（PnYnMnDTnHnMnS），可带有前导 '-'。值空间将月份分量和秒分量配对；仅定义了偏序。词法形式：'P' 后按年、月、日、小时、分钟、秒的顺序写入至少一个字段。如果包含小时、分钟或秒字段，在其中第一个字段前加 'T'。仅秒字段可带小数部分（例如 'P3Y6M4DT12H30M5.5S'、'-P15D'）。"@zh, "Time durations per ISO 8601 (PnYnMnDTnHnMnS), optionally with a leading '-'. Value space pairs a months component and a seconds component; only a partial order is defined. Lexical form: 'P' followed by one or more year, month, day, hour, minute, or second fields in that order. If any hour, minute, or second field is present, put 'T' before the first of those fields. Only the seconds field may have a fractional part (e.g., 'P3Y6M4DT12H30M5.5S', '-P15D')."@en .

xsd:yearMonthDuration
    rdfs:label "以年和月表示的时长"@zh, "yearMonthDuration"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "以年和月表示的时长"@zh, "year and month duration"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "yearMonthDuration"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "仅限年和月字段的时长（秒分量为 0）。具有全序；词法形式使用 PnYnM，可带有前导 '-'（例如 'P2Y'、'P3M'、'-P1Y2M'）。"@zh, "Durations restricted to year and month fields (seconds component is 0). Totally ordered; lexical form uses PnYnM with optional leading '-' (e.g., 'P2Y', 'P3M', '-P1Y2M')."@en .

xsd:dayTimeDuration
    rdfs:label "以天、小时、分钟和秒表示的时长"@zh, "dayTimeDuration"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "以天、小时、分钟和秒表示的时长"@zh, "duration in days, hours, minutes and seconds"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "dayTimeDuration"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "仅限天、小时、分钟和秒字段的时长（月份分量为 0）。具有全序；词法形式为 'PnDTnHnMnS'，可带有前导 '-' 和小数秒（例如 'P30D'、'PT12H30M'、'PT5.25S'、'-P1DT2H'）。"@zh, "Durations restricted to day, hour, minute, second fields (months component is 0). Totally ordered; lexical form 'PnDTnHnMnS' with optional leading '-' and optional fractional seconds (e.g., 'P30D', 'PT12H30M', 'PT5.25S', '-P1DT2H')."@en .

xsd:byte
    rdfs:label "8 位有符号整数"@zh, "byte"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 位有符号整数"@zh, "8-bit signed integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "byte"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "8 位有符号整数。值空间：[-128 .. 127]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟一个或多个数字；无小数点或指数（例如 '-1', '0', '+100'）。"@zh, "8-bit signed integers. Value space: [-128 .. 127]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by one or more digits; no decimal point or exponent (e.g., '-1', '0', '+100')."@en .

xsd:short
    rdfs:label "16 位有符号整数"@zh, "short"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 位有符号整数"@zh, "16-bit signed integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "short"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "16 位有符号整数。值空间：[-32768 .. 32767]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟一个或多个数字；无小数点或指数（例如 '-1', '0', '+10000'）。"@zh, "16-bit signed integers. Value space: [-32768 .. 32767]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by one or more digits; no decimal point or exponent (e.g., '-1', '0', '+10000')."@en .

xsd:int
    rdfs:label "32 位有符号整数"@zh, "int"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 位有符号整数"@zh, "32-bit signed integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "int"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "32 位有符号整数。值空间：[-2147483648 .. 2147483647]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟一个或多个数字；无小数点或指数（例如 '-1', '0', '+100000'）。"@zh, "32-bit signed integers. Value space: [-2147483648 .. 2147483647]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by one or more digits; no decimal point or exponent (e.g., '-1', '0', '+100000')."@en .

xsd:long
    rdfs:label "64 位有符号整数"@zh, "long"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "64 位有符号整数"@zh, "64-bit signed integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "long"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "64 位有符号整数。值空间：[-9223372036854775808 .. 9223372036854775807]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟一个或多个数字；无小数点或指数。"@zh, "64-bit signed integers. Value space: [-9223372036854775808 .. 9223372036854775807]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by one or more digits; no decimal point or exponent."@en .

xsd:unsignedByte
    rdfs:label "8 位无符号整数"@zh, "unsignedByte"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 位无符号整数"@zh, "8-bit unsigned integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "unsignedByte"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "8 位无符号整数。值空间：[0 .. 255]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟数字；若有符号则必须为 '+'，但 XSD 1.1 词法空间中的零可以带有可选的 '+' 或 '-' 符号。"@zh, "8-bit unsigned integers. Value space: [0 .. 255]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by digits; if a sign is present it must be '+', except that zero may be written with an optional '+' or '-' sign in XSD 1.1 lexical space."@en .

xsd:unsignedShort
    rdfs:label "16 位无符号整数"@zh, "unsignedShort"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 位无符号整数"@zh, "16-bit unsigned integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "unsignedShort"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "16 位无符号整数。值空间：[0 .. 65535]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟数字；若有符号则必须为 '+'，但 XSD 1.1 词法空间中的零可以带有可选的 '+' 或 '-' 符号。"@zh, "16-bit unsigned integers. Value space: [0 .. 65535]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by digits; if a sign is present it must be '+', except that zero may be written with an optional '+' or '-' sign in XSD 1.1 lexical space."@en .

xsd:unsignedInt
    rdfs:label "32 位无符号整数"@zh, "unsignedInt"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "32 位无符号整数"@zh, "32-bit unsigned integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "unsignedInt"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "32 位无符号整数。值空间：[0 .. 4294967295]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟数字；若有符号则必须为 '+'，但 XSD 1.1 词法空间中的零可以带有可选的 '+' 或 '-' 符号。"@zh, "32-bit unsigned integers. Value space: [0 .. 4294967295]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by digits; if a sign is present it must be '+', except that zero may be written with an optional '+' or '-' sign in XSD 1.1 lexical space."@en .

xsd:unsignedLong
    rdfs:label "64 位无符号整数"@zh, "unsignedLong"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "64 位无符号整数"@zh, "64-bit unsigned integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "unsignedLong"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "64 位无符号整数。值空间：[0 .. 18446744073709551615]。词法形式：可选的符号后跟数字；若有符号则必须为 '+'，但 XSD 1.1 词法空间中的零可以带有可选的 '+' 或 '-' 符号。"@zh, "64-bit unsigned integers. Value space: [0 .. 18446744073709551615]. Lexical form: optional sign followed by digits; if a sign is present it must be '+', except that zero may be written with an optional '+' or '-' sign in XSD 1.1 lexical space."@en .

xsd:positiveInteger
    rdfs:label "正整数"@zh, "positiveInteger"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "正整数"@zh, "positive integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "positiveInteger"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "大于零的整数。值空间：{1, 2, ...}。通过 minInclusive=1 从 xsd:nonNegativeInteger 派生。词法形式：可选的 '+' 符号后跟一个或多个数字；无零或负数形式。"@zh, "Integers greater than zero. Value space: {1, 2, ...}. Derived from xsd:nonNegativeInteger with minInclusive=1. Lexical form: optional '+' sign followed by one or more digits; no zero or negative forms."@en .

xsd:nonNegativeInteger
    rdfs:label "非负整数"@zh, "nonNegativeInteger"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "非负整数"@zh, "non-negative integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "nonNegativeInteger"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "大于或等于零的整数。值空间：{0, 1, 2, ...}。词法形式：可选的符号后跟数字；若有符号则必须为 '+'，但零可以带有可选的 '+' 或 '-' 符号。"@zh, "Integers greater than or equal to zero. Value space: {0, 1, 2, ...}. Lexical form: optional sign followed by digits; if a sign is present it must be '+', except that zero may be written with an optional '+' or '-' sign."@en .

xsd:negativeInteger
    rdfs:label "负整数"@zh, "negativeInteger"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "负整数"@zh, "negative integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "negativeInteger"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "小于零的整数。值空间：{..., -2, -1}。通过 maxInclusive=-1 从 xsd:nonPositiveInteger 派生。词法形式：必需的 '-' 符号后跟一个或多个数字。"@zh, "Integers less than zero. Value space: {..., -2, -1}. Derived from xsd:nonPositiveInteger with maxInclusive=-1. Lexical form: mandatory '-' sign followed by one or more digits."@en .

xsd:nonPositiveInteger
    rdfs:label "非正整数"@zh, "nonPositiveInteger"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "非正整数"@zh, "non-positive integer"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "nonPositiveInteger"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "小于或等于零的整数。值空间：{..., -2, -1, 0}。词法形式：零的符号可选，否则必须为 '-' 符号后跟数字。"@zh, "Integers less than or equal to zero. Value space: {..., -2, -1, 0}. Lexical form: optional sign for zero, otherwise a mandatory '-' sign followed by digits."@en .

xsd:hexBinary
    rdfs:label "十六进制编码的二进制数据"@zh, "hexBinary"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "十六进制编码的二进制数据"@zh, "hexadecimal binary data"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "hexBinary"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "以成对的十六进制数字编码的任意二进制数据；每个八位组用两个十六进制字符 [0-9A-Fa-f] 表示。词法形式：偶数长度的十六进制数字序列；每两个十六进制数字编码一个八位组（例如 '0FB7'）。"@zh, "Arbitrary binary data encoded as pairs of hexadecimal digits; each octet is represented by two hex characters [0-9A-Fa-f]. Lexical form: an even-length sequence of hexadecimal digits; two hex digits encode each octet (e.g., '0FB7')."@en .

xsd:base64Binary
    rdfs:label "Base64 编码的二进制数据"@zh, "base64Binary"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Base64 编码的二进制数据"@zh, "Base64 binary data"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "base64Binary"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "使用 Base64 编码的任意二进制数据。Base64 字母表遵循 RFC 4648；词法形式和空白处理遵循 XML Schema 规则。词法形式：Base64 字母表 'A–Z'、'a–z'、'0–9'、'+'、'/'，可带有 '=' 填充；验证时折叠空白。"@zh, "Arbitrary binary data encoded using Base64. Base64 alphabet per RFC 4648; lexical forms and whitespace handling follow XML Schema rules. Lexical form: Base64 alphabet 'A–Z', 'a–z', '0–9', '+', '/' with optional '=' padding; whitespace is collapsed during validation."@en .

xsd:anyURI
    rdfs:label "IRI 引用"@zh, "anyURI"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "IRI 引用"@zh, "IRI reference"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "anyURI"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "RFC 3987 规定的国际化资源标识符（IRI）或 IRI 引用。词法空间就是 xsd:string（XSD 不强制采用固定语法）；典型词法形式包括绝对或相对 IRI 及可选的片段标识符；处理器可以应用转义／IRI 到 URI 的映射。"@zh, "Internationalized Resource Identifiers (IRIs) or IRI references per RFC 3987. Lexical space is simply xsd:string (no fixed grammar is enforced by XSD); typical lexical forms include absolute or relative IRIs and optional fragment identifiers; processors may apply escaping/IRI-to-URI mapping."@en .

xsd:language
    rdfs:label "语言标识符"@zh, "language"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "语言标识符"@zh, "language identifier"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "language"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "BCP 47 规定的自然语言标识符。词法模式：[a-zA-Z]{1,8}(-[a-zA-Z0-9]{1,8})*。"@zh, "Natural language identifiers per BCP 47. Lexical pattern: [a-zA-Z]{1,8}(-[a-zA-Z0-9]{1,8})*."@en .

xsd:normalizedString
    rdfs:label "规范化字符串"@zh, "normalizedString"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "规范化字符串"@zh, "normalized string"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "normalizedString"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "不允许包含回车、换行和制表字符的字符串。从 xsd:string 派生；空白规范化将这些字符替换为空格。词法形式：不包含 #xD、#xA 或 #x9（按 XML 定义）的任意字符串，即在规范化过程中替换了这些字符的字符串。"@zh, "Strings with carriage return, line feed, and tab characters disallowed. Derived from xsd:string; whitespace normalized to replace those characters with spaces. Lexical form: any string not containing #xD, #xA or #x9 (per XML), i.e., with those characters replaced during normalization."@en .

xsd:token
    rdfs:label "标记化字符串"@zh, "token"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "标记化字符串"@zh, "tokenized string"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "token"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "从 xsd:normalizedString 派生的标记化字符串：没有前导或尾随空格，内部也没有连续多个空格。词法形式：空白经过折叠的字符串（连续空格折叠为单个空格；移除前导／尾随空格）。"@zh, "Tokenized strings derived from xsd:normalizedString: no leading or trailing spaces and no internal sequences of multiple spaces. Lexical form: strings with whitespace collapsed (runs of spaces collapsed to a single space; leading/trailing spaces removed)."@en .

xsd:NMTOKEN
    rdfs:label "XML 名称标记"@zh, "NMTOKEN"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "XML 名称标记"@zh, "XML name token"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "NMTOKEN"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "符合 XML Nmtoken 产生式的名称标记。从 xsd:token 派生。词法形式：按 XML 定义的一个或多个 NameChar（即符合 XML Nmtoken 产生式）。"@zh, "Values matching the XML Nmtoken production. Derived from xsd:token. Lexical form: one or more NameChar per XML (i.e., matches the XML Nmtoken production)."@en .

xsd:Name
    rdfs:label "XML 名称"@zh, "Name"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "XML 名称"@zh, "XML name"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "Name"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "符合 XML Name 产生式的名称。从 xsd:token 派生。词法形式：按 XML 定义的 NameStartChar 后跟零个或多个 NameChar。"@zh, "Values matching the XML Name production. Derived from xsd:token. Lexical form: NameStartChar followed by zero or more NameChar per XML."@en .

xsd:NCName
    rdfs:label "不含冒号的 XML 名称"@zh, "NCName"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "不含冒号的 XML 名称"@zh, "XML name without a colon"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "NCName"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "符合 NCName 产生式的 XML“不含冒号的”名称（即不含冒号的 Name）。从 xsd:Name 派生。词法形式：XML NCName（与 Name 相同，但不允许 ':'）。"@zh, "XML 'non-colonized' names matching the NCName production (i.e., Name without the colon). Derived from xsd:Name. Lexical form: XML NCName (same as Name but disallowing ':')."@en .
